                                "sense_id": "7b20ffea-01ed-357c-b030-155d4bcfe453",
                                "text": "And how then was the Devil drest? / Oh! he was in his Sunday's best: / His jacket was red and his breeches were blue, / And there was a hole where the tail came through."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
